      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "encoder_type   = name\ncompute_heads  = isinstance(readout,\n                            HeadReadout)\nwp_pool_size   ← readout.wp_side\n                 (\"dense\" → default 37)\nfeature_kind   ← readout + input_layout\nmodule_cls     = dreamer.module_cls\n\nThis part is a GOOD abstraction.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
