      "seed": 9500285,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1738407156,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784099608831,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "grep '\\.kind' over src/ tests/ scripts/  →  no hits.\n\n  DreamerEncoderSpec.kind    declared 12× (1st positional), read 0×\n  HeadReadout.kind  = Literal[\"heads\"]     read 0×\n  TokenReadout.kind = Literal[\"tokens\"]    read 0×\n\nThe Literal discriminators were meant for a tagged union, but every\nread site uses isinstance(readout, HeadReadout) instead (5 sites).\n\n⇒ The fold can simply DROP `kind`. Free deletion, no derivation needed.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "grep '\\.kind' over src/ tests/ scripts/  →  no hits.\n\n  DreamerEncoderSpec.kind    declared 12× (1st positional), read 0×\n  HeadReadout.kind  = Literal[\"heads\"]     read 0×\n  TokenReadout.kind = Literal[\"tokens\"]    read 0×\n\nThe Literal discriminators were meant for a tagged union, but every\nread site uses isinstance(readout, HeadReadout) instead (5 sites).\n\n⇒ The fold can simply DROP `kind`. Free deletion, no derivation needed.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "al",
      "autoResize": true
    },
