      "updated": 1784099608831,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⚠ `input_layout` is load-bearing but UNLISTED",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚠ `input_layout` is load-bearing but UNLISTED",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "an",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gap_b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 738,
      "y": 1194,
      "width": 471.90000000000003,
      "height": 169.00000000000003,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 10100303,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1818628812,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784099608831,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "proposal.md says each Encoder owns:\n    readout · storage · module_cls · module_kwargs_from_config\n\nBut input_layout has 2 live read sites:\n  vggt.py:139   feature_kind ← 'structured_wp_cp' → \"wp64_cp\"\n  vggt.py:578   encoder_input_by_layout[spec.dreamer.input_layout]\n\n⇒ Drop DreamerEncoderSpec without porting input_layout and\n   feature_kind silently returns \"wp_cp\" for vggt_wp64_cnn_cp_mlp.\n   The golden fixture (task 1.1) WOULD catch this. Good.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "proposal.md says each Encoder owns:\n    readout · storage · module_cls · module_kwargs_from_config\n\nBut input_layout has 2 live read sites:\n  vggt.py:139   feature_kind ← 'structured_wp_cp' → \"wp64_cp\"\n  vggt.py:578   encoder_input_by_layout[spec.dreamer.input_layout]\n\n⇒ Drop DreamerEncoderSpec without porting input_layout and\n   feature_kind silently returns \"wp_cp\" for vggt_wp64_cnn_cp_mlp.\n   The golden fixture (task 1.1) WOULD catch this. Good.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ao",
      "autoResize": true
    },
