      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⇒ DreamerEncoderSpec collapses 3 → 2",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⇒ DreamerEncoderSpec collapses 3 → 2",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aq",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "verdict_b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1418,
      "y": 1194,
      "width": 464.75000000000006,
      "height": 152.10000000000002,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 10700321,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 292303220,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784099608831,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "kind          ✗ delete (dead)\nmodule_cls    → Encoder.module_cls   (proposal already says this)\ninput_layout  → Encoder.input_layout (ADD to proposal / task 2.1)\n\nOnce those two move onto the class, DreamerEncoderSpec has\nnothing left to hold and dies with VGGTDreamerSpec.\n\nStorageSpec does NOT collapse — it survives as a value type,\njust re-homed. That asymmetry is the whole point of ④.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "kind          ✗ delete (dead)\nmodule_cls    → Encoder.module_cls   (proposal already says this)\ninput_layout  → Encoder.input_layout (ADD to proposal / task 2.1)\n\nOnce those two move onto the class, DreamerEncoderSpec has\nnothing left to hold and dies with VGGTDreamerSpec.\n\nStorageSpec does NOT collapse — it survives as a value type,\njust re-homed. That asymmetry is the whole point of ④.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ar",
      "autoResize": true
    },
