      "locked": false,
      "text": "observation_preparation/vggt.py\n        │\n        ▼\nencoders/base.py\n        │\n        ▼\nencoders/{mlp, transformer, cnn}.py     ← import nothing back\n\nVerified: mlp/transformer/cnn/constants import neither base.py\nnor observation_preparation. base.py already pulls flax via cnn.py,\nso the eager-import cost is bounded (measure it — task 1.5 / 2.8).",
