      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784099608831,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "EncoderInputContract.to_snapshot() writes:\n\n  \"encoder_module\": module_class_path(self.encoder_module_cls)\n  → \"src.r2dreamer.encoders.transformer.TokenTransformerEncoder\"\n\nfrom_snapshot() reverses it with _import_class().\nThe string is f\"{cls.__module__}.{cls.__qualname__}\".\n\n⇒ No nn.Module may change module or qualname.\n   Only launcher-side selection data moves.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EncoderInputContract.to_snapshot() writes:\n\n  \"encoder_module\": module_class_path(self.encoder_module_cls)\n  → \"src.r2dreamer.encoders.transformer.TokenTransformerEncoder\"\n\nfrom_snapshot() reverses it with _import_class().\nThe string is f\"{cls.__module__}.{cls.__qualname__}\".\n\n⇒ No nn.Module may change module or qualname.\n   Only launcher-side selection data moves.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0N",
      "autoResize": true
    },
