      "originalText": "Golden to_snapshot() fixture — all 18 registry entries,\nbyte-equality before vs. after.\n\n  \"It is not a proxy for correctness — it IS the\n   contract that evaluate and from_checkpoint depend on.\"\n\nOrdering matters: fixture must exist and pass on main\nunmodified (task 1.6) or the test proves nothing.\n\nPlus: registry key-set test + resolved-kwargs fixture.",
